/* —— 启动闸门告警（NSLog，给接入方开发者看）—— */
"检测到 App Store 正式包，Telepath 已停止启动。请确认 Podfile 中 Telepath 仅出现在非 App Store 提交用的构建配置里（配置名因工程而异，不一定叫 Debug）。" = "App Store build detected — Telepath did not start. Make sure Telepath is only in build configurations that are never submitted to the App Store (the name varies by project; it is not always Debug).";
"检测到 TestFlight 构建，Telepath 默认不在此启动。TestFlight 面向真实外部测试者，如确需调试，请显式设置 config.allowTestFlight = YES。" = "TestFlight build detected — Telepath does not start here by default. TestFlight reaches real external testers; set config.allowTestFlight = YES if you really need it.";
"无法确定构建的分发渠道（既无描述文件也无收据文件）。Telepath 将继续启动，但请自行确认此包不会提交 App Store。" = "Could not determine the distribution channel (no provisioning profile and no receipt). Telepath will start anyway — make sure this build is never submitted to the App Store.";
"有新进展" = "Updated";

